=== {{S|adjectif|en}} ===
{{en-adj-er-e|awar}}
'''aware''' 
# [[au courant|Au courant]], [[conscient]].
#* {{exemple | lang=en | Are you '''aware''' that she was looking your way the whole evening?}}
#* {{exemple | lang=en | Are you '''aware''' of the implications if this theory turns out to be true?}}

